 "remarks": "Renovated Glenbrook Townhouse for Rent. Welcome home to this beautifully renovated townhouse in desirable Glenbrook! This spacious two-bedroom, 1.5-bath rental has been thoughtfully updated and is super clean, move-in ready. The home features newer carpeting throughout, newer appliances, newer kitchen cabinetry and countertops, and custom tile work, and recently professionally paint throughout. The spacious layout offers plenty of natural light, generous closet and storage space, and all the comforts you're looking for in a great rental home. Additional highlights include: Newly renovated kitchen with new cabinets, countertops, and appliances Custom tile work, Full-size washer and dryer, Ample closet and storage space. Two off-street parking spaces. Super clean and ready for occupancy. Ideally located in the sought-after Glenbrook neighborhood, this is a fantastic opportunity to enjoy a beautifully updated home in a convenient and desirable location. Walking distance to restaurants, CVS, and other everyday conveniences. A commuter's delight, with the Glenbrook Train Station just a 15-minute walk away and easy access to I-95, only a 5-minute drive. Nothing to do but move in and enjoy!",
